+/// MISSION_DIRECTOR_V0 (OXCE_AI_MDIR): 0 - off, 1 - shadow: [AIMISSION] lines about what a base defense asks of the hostile side and what comes of
+/// it, the plan and the orders written, nothing changed; 2 - the orders on.
